{
  "name": "forethought",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Educational privacy impact assessment workbench: a ten-question rubric drives a weighted likelihood-and-impact model across privacy risk themes, mitigations reduce residual risk only when implemented, approval invariants block sign-off, and every version is hashed and exportable. Browser-local synthetic data only.",
